license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/somphol/khan-trig-unit1-right-triangle-studio"
url: "https://somphol.github.io/khan-trig-unit1-right-triangle-studio/"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free, bilingual (English and Thai) interactive companion for
  Khan Academy Trigonometry Unit 1. Four canvas studios cover SOH-CAH-TOA and
  ratio constancy, 45-45-90 and 30-60-90 special triangles, reciprocal ratios,
  and a practice sandbox with generated problems, step-by-step solutions,
  streaks and badges. The site runs entirely in the browser and stores progress
  locally.
keywords:
  - trigonometry
  - right triangles
  - SOH-CAH-TOA
  - special right triangles
  - reciprocal trigonometric ratios
  - mathematics education
  - interactive learning
  - bilingual education
  - Thai
  - HTML5 Canvas
